<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Union Dicon Salt 7-month profit.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Union Dicon Salt 7-month profit.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven-month result for Union Dicon Salt to end-July 1996 versus 12-month to end-December 1995.</p>
<p>(In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996	  1995</p>
<p>Turnover			2,800  vs   2,700</p>
<p>Profit before taxation	363  vs     410</p>
<p>Taxation			 0.07  vs	 1</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	 363  vs     409</p>
<p>Dividend per share (naira) 1.50  vs    2.00</p>
<p>Bonus issue: one new share for six</p>
<p>NOTE - Union Dicon Salt Plc, which was on tax holiday until last year, is changing its accounting year to end-July from end-December previously.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
